Welcome to Ganymede, Major. We have discovered a Russian base not far from here, where they are working on some new technology. It is essential that they are not allowed to continue this work - it is the express wish of the leaders of the Red Army that the People's Republic become the new owner of this technology, whatever it may be. Your first task will be to investigate the building where the work is being carried out - after that, you will be given new orders as you proceed.

MISSION OBJECTIVES:
- Investigate the Russian lab facilities.
- Deploy your Recycler.
- Protect your Recycler. Build Turrets to help.
- Await further orders.

SPECIAL NOTES FROM CHIEF OF STAFF:
This mission, and others to follow, are intended for experienced field commanders. If you are not up to the job, we suggest you return to your barracks!